@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### TASK 08 - List all products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/

### TASK 08 - Products with price >= 50
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/?min_price=50

### TASK 08 - Products with price <= 100
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/?max_price=100

### TASK 08 - Products with price between 50 and 100
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/?min_price=50&max_price=100

### TASK 08 - Products with price between 100 and 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/?min_price=100&max_price=200

### TASK 08 - Products with price between 200 and 300
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/?min_price=200&max_price=300
